{"3963630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rosie", "steam_appid": 3963630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosie is a horror adventure game that takes place inside multiple virtual pop-up books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Rosie. A 6-year-old who lives with her family at the top of the hill of a small town. The townsfolk avoid the family, as they claim to see ghosts and demons. Rosie is starting to question this for herself. Help Rosie discover different paths she can take and decide her ultimate fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are ghosts and demons real? Or is it all in the family’s head? Decide for yourself as you unravel the mysteries of the world through quests and interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and World Exploration:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       Unlock new areas. Discover story elements. Interact with environment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and Whimsical Visuals:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       2D characters and cutesy drawn interactable inside a book like 3D world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       Decide the ending after experimenting with decisions.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosie is a horror adventure game that takes place inside multiple virtual pop-up books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Rosie. A 6-year-old who lives with her family at the top of the hill of a small town. The townsfolk avoid the family, as they claim to see ghosts and demons. Rosie is starting to question this for herself. Help Rosie discover different paths she can take and d